      "content": "idk i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now work is crazy and i dont have insurance... its just a UTI right? its not like its life or death. i just want to know if the 100mg twice a day is a standard dose for a normal adult so i can just get through the week. i'm pretty sure my kidneys are fine enough for a little bit of macrobid.",
