    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i hear you about the clinic but i literally cannot go. i just need to know if i can just try some high dose vitamin c instead to flush it out? i've heard that works for utis and it's way safer for my kidneys than taking random antibiotics. would like 2000mg or something a day be enough to clear the infection if i can't get the macrobid to work?",
